1
00:00:02,334 --> 00:00:04,934
(Sheldon:)Leonard, I've been working
on an opening joke

2
00:00:04,939 --> 00:00:06,439
(Sheldon:)for our lecture at Berkeley.

3
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:07,610
(Leonard:)Oh, I like to laugh.

4
00:00:07,608 --> 00:00:09,008
(Leonard:)But say it anyway.

5
00:00:10,143 --> 00:00:12,073
(Sheldon:)Okay, um...

6
00:00:12,079 --> 00:00:14,749
(Sheldon:)What do you say
to a graduate

7
00:00:14,749 --> 00:00:17,049
(Sheldon:)of the UC Berkeley
physics department?

8
00:00:17,051 --> 00:00:19,481
(Sheldon:)I'll have fries with that.
(chuckles)

9
00:00:20,587 --> 00:00:22,587
(Sheldon:)Because his education
hasn't prepared him

10
00:00:22,590 --> 00:00:24,320
(Sheldon:)for a career in the sciences.

11
00:00:26,626 --> 00:00:28,296
(Penny:)You know, when they chase
you out of there,

12
00:00:28,295 --> 00:00:29,865
(Penny:)you only have to run
faster than Sheldon.

13
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:32,060
(Amy:)Are you all set
for your trip?

14
00:00:32,066 --> 00:00:33,396
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I think so.

15
00:00:33,401 --> 00:00:36,631
(Sheldon:)I just restocked the old PRK.

16
00:00:36,637 --> 00:00:37,637
"PRK"?

17
00:00:37,638 --> 00:00:39,038
(Leonard:)Public restroom kit.

18
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:42,910
(Leonard:)Everything a boy needs
for making pee pee

19
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:45,110
(Leonard:)in new and strange places.

20
00:00:45,112 --> 00:00:47,682
(Sheldon:)I don't see what's crazy
about bringing a backpack

21
00:00:47,681 --> 00:00:49,951
(Sheldon:)with your own toilet paper
and Purell.

22
00:00:49,950 --> 00:00:52,120
(Leonard:)Keep going.

23
00:00:52,119 --> 00:00:54,849
(Sheldon:)And rubber gloves,
uh, air freshener.

24
00:00:54,855 --> 00:00:57,425
(Sheldon:)Um, noise-cancelling
headphones.

25
00:00:57,425 --> 00:00:58,995
(Sheldon:)Oh, danger whistle.

26
00:00:58,993 --> 00:01:00,263
(Sheldon:)Um...

27
00:01:00,261 --> 00:01:01,661
(Sheldon:)pepper spray.

28
00:01:01,662 --> 00:01:04,562
(Sheldon:)Ooh, a multi-language
"occupied" sign.

29
00:01:04,565 --> 00:01:06,035
(Sheldon:)Uh, let's see.

30
00:01:06,033 --> 00:01:09,373
(Sheldon:)We have seat protectors,
uh, booties for my shoes,

31
00:01:09,370 --> 00:01:11,440
(Sheldon:)a clothespin for my nose.

32
00:01:11,439 --> 00:01:14,769
(Sheldon:)Oh, and a mirror on a stick,

33
00:01:14,775 --> 00:01:17,105
(Sheldon:)so I can make sure the person
in the stall next to me

34
00:01:17,111 --> 00:01:18,841
(Sheldon:)isn't some kind of weirdo.

35
00:01:21,714 --> 00:01:24,754
(Penny:)You still worried some Berkeley
girl is gonna steal him away?

36
00:01:24,752 --> 00:01:28,152
(Amy:)Yes, who do you think gave him
the danger whistle?

37
00:01:30,190 --> 00:01:33,790
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

